  "baseRefName": "main",
  "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds an opt-in **agent self-improvement route** that lets Sepo propose and apply improvements to itself.\n\n- **`agent-self-improvement.yml`** — opt-in scheduled/manual planner workflow\n- **`agent-self-improvement` prompt** — planner guidance\n- **Deterministic decision application** — `apply-self-improvement-decision` CLI applies an approved self-improvement decision reproducibly\n- **Requester resolution** — `resolve-self-improvement-requester` CLI + `self-improvement-requester.ts` scope who may request or trust a proposal\n- **Core route** — `self-improvement.ts` (markers, trace comments, and orchestrator dispatch wiring)\n- **Docs + regression coverage** — configuration list, supported-workflows docs, and unit tests\n",
